OL,3,AAberfan stops to remember 60 years
OL,4,Asince coal tip collapsed, killing 116
OL,5,Achildren and 28 adults
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe tragedy was said to be the late
OL,8,FQueen Elizabeth's biggest regret that
OL,9,Fshe didn't visit until eight days after
OL,10,Fthe disaster - she later returned to
OL,11,Fthe village in Merthyr Tydfil county a
OL,12,Ffurther three times
